Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(310,34)}Easy Sage Course Kit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.32,0:00:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.99,0:00:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's meet up here at 4 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.83,0:00:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Got ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.83,0:00:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for being late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.73,0:00:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I had trouble with teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.17,0:00:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to finish my homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.14,0:00:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.51,0:00:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going camping!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.51,0:00:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You all are going camping with Suneo's cousin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.38,0:00:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll join you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.22,0:00:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.22,0:00:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to do your homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.86,0:00:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'll be blunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.13,0:00:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your homework is more important than coming to camp with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.03,0:01:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Dekisugi-{\i1}san{\i0} is right. You should reconsider camping with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.11,0:01:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't mean that...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.31,0:01:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you doing at this late?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.75,0:01:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.05,0:01:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not going to cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.72,0:01:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You were scolded by your teacher for getting 0, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.73,0:01:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.10,0:01:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.83,0:01:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.07,0:01:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the usual?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.04,0:01:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Not you too, Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.97,0:01:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to live on some distant mountain, all by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.55,0:01:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow. You are talking like a sage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.22,0:01:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A Sage?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.59,0:01:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.29,0:01:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen a poster like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.23,0:01:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A sage, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.33,0:01:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an old Chinese legend....
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.50,0:02:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Isolating oneself from the world and live deep in the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.77,0:02:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Meditating under waterfall to obtain supernatural powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.17,0:02:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's almost magical, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.01,0:02:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, suppose you can say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.81,0:02:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to know about the magical part of it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.22,0:02:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna become a sage too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.92,0:02:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I mentioned it as just an old legend, Remember?.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.09,0:02:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible for you to beocme a sage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.03,0:02:29.53,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\c&H235E57&\pos(425.865,214.8)}Easy {\c&HB48F5F&}Sage\N {\c&H235E57&}Course Kit
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.09,0:02:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, what's an Easy Sage Course Kit?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.13,0:02:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A gadget to become a sage?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.86,0:02:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme that! i'll be borrowing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.97,0:02:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.77,0:02:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.77,0:02:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.77,0:02:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you don't want to do your homework?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.04,0:02:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come crying to me later, if mum scolds you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.21,0:02:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If I become a sage, studying would be like a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.15,0:02:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to undergo harsh practices, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.29,0:02:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I am ready to undergo even the harshest practices so that...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.96,0:03:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,...I can become a sage!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.73,0:03:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.73,0:03:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You won't join me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.67,0:03:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course. You have to be all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.54,0:03:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so cold! Okay, fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.58,0:03:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go to a snowy mountain with a waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.78,0:03:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.42,0:03:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see what all does this Easy Sage Course Kit contains...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.82,0:03:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.59,0:03:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an outfit of a sage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.39,0:03:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this small shrine? It's connected to this air pump.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.56,0:03:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.24,0:03:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So I have to sit inside this shrine and train!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.75,0:03:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:04:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's very spacious inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's so small.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.20,0:04:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,How disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.30,0:04:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Doll of a Sage?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This idol is my master!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.74,0:04:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I''m Nobita! Teach me how to become a sage!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.08,0:04:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be easy on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.74,0:04:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate difficulty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.74,0:04:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.95,0:04:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that how you speak to your master?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch! Depsite your small stature, you sure are cocky as hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.07,0:04:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you mock me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.81,0:04:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Think you can be swifter than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.58,0:05:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,For being just a robot, you're so cocky!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.31,0:05:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.06,0:05:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunderstorm!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.23,0:05:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.00,0:05:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive my rudeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.44,0:05:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright. Now you can be my disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.91,0:05:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean it? Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.92,0:05:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,First I'll teach you the technique to ride on a cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.05,0:05:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I ride on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.49,0:05:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, how do I ride it, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.06,0:05:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so easy, you just have to stand on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.06,0:05:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Try it! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.40,0:05:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally? Alright, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.87,0:06:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, what a clumsy disciple!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.94,0:06:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to start your training from the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.38,0:06:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,training from the heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.81,0:06:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,First you have to align your heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.22,0:06:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, you have to empty the inside of your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.55,0:06:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.26,0:06:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your head is so empty
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not just about the head!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.30,0:06:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.17,0:06:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Will empty...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool, who told you to fall asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.42,0:06:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thunderstorm!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.96,0:06:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell asleep while trying to empty my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.66,0:06:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to take the training seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:07:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, practice it all alone for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.90,0:07:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember to train!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.07,0:07:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.71,0:07:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0} is doing his training properly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.25,0:07:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll go check on him for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.02,0:07:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised to see him like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.37,0:07:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.28,0:12:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.28,0:12:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this strange doll doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.28,0:12:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.28,0:12:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so hypocrite, sage. You were the one who told me to be pure hearted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.06,0:12:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But you are perverted as always, want to see that too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.73,0:12:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,See what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.88,0:12:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-chan's panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.34,0:12:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So you haven't matured spiritually at all yet, have you?
